<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings nearly halved last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings nearly halved last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent blend loadings from Britan's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 529,088 tonnes in the week to February 4 compared to 1,022,557 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>A third of this oil, or 175,834 tonnes went to refineries in north America while the rest remained in northwest Europe.</p>
